OL,3,ATrump meets US-backed Venezuelan
OL,4,Apresident for first time since Maduro
OL,5,Aseized
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS President Donald Trump has held
OL,8,Ftalks with Venezuela's interim
OL,9,FPresident Delcy Rodriguez at the UN
OL,10,FGeneral Assembly, their first
OL,11,Fface-to-face meeting since the White
OL,12,FHouse backed her to take over the South
OL,13,FAmerican country's government.
OL,15,FRodriguez succeeded Nicolas Maduro
OL,16,Fshortly after US forces conducted a
OL,17,Fraid on the Venezuelan capital Caracas
OL,18,Fand seized him.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
