OL,3,ATrump meets US-backed Venezuelan
OL,4,Apresident for first time since Maduro
OL,5,Aseized
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe pair met a few kilometres from the
OL,8,FNew York jail where Maduro is awaiting
OL,9,Ftrial for drug trafficking and other
OL,10,Fcharges.
OL,12,FRodriguez said they discussed
OL,13,F"advancing a cooperation agenda in
OL,14,Fstrategic areas such as energy, mining,
OL,15,Fand security".
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
